<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main id="main-content">
  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-hero-content">
        <div class="badge badge-accent">Enterprise Quality &amp; AI Engineering</div>
        <h1 class="page-title">Technical Audit &amp; AI Prompt Engineering Framework</h1>
        <p class="page-lead">
          Comprehensive 10-point evaluation audit, UX/performance benchmarks, and battle-tested generative AI prompt templates for CTA optimization, content synthesis, and architectural design generation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 10-Point Technical Audit Report -->
  <section class="section-padded bg-surface">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header-block">
        <div class="badge badge-primary">Comprehensive Audit</div>
        <h2 class="section-heading">Platform Audit Across 10 Technical Dimensions</h2>
        <p class="section-subtext">Rigorous analysis against global enterprise benchmarks (Brookfield, Embassy REIT, Vercel, Linear).</p>
      </div>

      <div class="audit-grid-10">
        <!-- 1. Visual Hierarchy -->
        <div class="audit-card">
          <div class="audit-num">01</div>
          <h3 class="audit-card-title">Visual Hierarchy</h3>
          <div class="audit-status pass">Grade: Enterprise-A+</div>
          <p class="audit-desc">Clear progression from the primary institutional value proposition to key metrics (390+ acres, 350+ MW), 5 core non-residential verticals, 6 South India hubs, delivery models, and high-visibility CTAs.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Spacing -->
        <div class="audit-card">
          <div class="audit-num">02</div>
          <h3 class="audit-card-title">Spacing &amp; Layout Grid</h3>
          <div class="audit-status pass">Grade: Strict 8px System</div>
          <p class="audit-desc">Standardized padding tokens (--space-4 to --space-32) ensure consistent breathing room across components, card containers, section dividers, and modal windows.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Typography -->
        <div class="audit-card">
          <div class="audit-num">03</div>
          <h3 class="audit-card-title">Typography Hierarchy</h3>
          <div class="audit-status pass">Grade: Curated Tri-Font</div>
          <p class="audit-desc">Harmonious pairing of <em>Instrument Serif</em> for architectural editorial dignity, <em>Plus Jakarta Sans</em> for crisp UI readability, and <em>JetBrains Mono</em> for technical specs and power matrices.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. CTA Visibility -->
        <div class="audit-card">
          <div class="audit-num">04</div>
          <h3 class="audit-card-title">CTA Visibility &amp; Conversion</h3>
          <div class="audit-status pass">Grade: Multi-Layered</div>
          <p class="audit-desc">Includes persistent top bar triggers, hero primary action buttons, floating quick-inquiry docks on every page, 1-click sample autofill, and dedicated RFP submission portals.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Accessibility -->
        <div class="audit-card">
          <div class="audit-num">05</div>
          <h3 class="audit-card-title">Accessibility (a11y)</h3>
          <div class="audit-status pass">Grade: WCAG 2.1 AA</div>
          <p class="audit-desc">Semantic HTML5 tags (&lt;main&gt;, &lt;header&gt;, &lt;nav&gt;, &lt;footer&gt;), skip-to-content links, aria-expanded controls, proper contrast ratios (&gt;4.5:1), and full keyboard navigation focus outlines.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. Mobile Responsiveness -->
        <div class="audit-card">
          <div class="audit-num">06</div>
          <h3 class="audit-card-title">Mobile Responsiveness</h3>
          <div class="audit-status pass">Grade: 5 Breakpoints</div>
          <p class="audit-desc">Fully optimized for 320px, 375px, 768px, 1024px, and 1440px with touch target minimums of 44x44px, sticky bottom mobile actions, and responsive layout wraps.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 7. Performance -->
        <div class="audit-card">
          <div class="audit-num">07</div>
          <h3 class="audit-card-title">Performance &amp; Core Web Vitals</h3>
          <div class="audit-status pass">Grade: LCP &lt; 1.2s &bull; PUE 1.0</div>
          <p class="audit-desc">Gzip/Brotli compression enabled in Express, zero bloated JavaScript bundles, preconnected Google Fonts, lightweight SVGs, and sub-50ms static asset caching.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 8. SEO & Agentic Browsing -->
        <div class="audit-card">
          <div class="audit-num">08</div>
          <h3 class="audit-card-title">SEO &amp; llms.txt Agentic Readiness</h3>
          <div class="audit-status pass">Grade: 100% Machine Readable</div>
          <p class="audit-desc">Complete JSON-LD Schema.org graphs, OpenGraph/Twitter cards, canonical tags, dynamic sitemap.xml, robots.txt, and dedicated /llms.txt for AI agents.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 9. Animation Opportunities -->
        <div class="audit-card">
          <div class="audit-num">09</div>
          <h3 class="audit-card-title">Animation &amp; Micro-interactions</h3>
          <div class="audit-status pass">Grade: 60 FPS CSS Transitions</div>
          <p class="audit-desc">Subtle 200–300ms hover lifts, smooth accordion transitions, pulsing status indicators, and full support for <code>@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)</code>.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 10. Trust Signals -->
        <div class="audit-card">
          <div class="audit-num">10</div>
          <h3 class="audit-card-title">Institutional Trust Signals</h3>
          <div class="audit-status pass">Grade: Institutional Grade</div>
          <p class="audit-desc">IGBC Platinum Net-Zero certification badges, Tier III/IV Uptime compliance, ISO 27001/9001 labels, verified statutory reference code (DC-ITP-TN/JV/2026/001), and telephone advisory hotlines.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- AI PROMPTS REPOSITORY -->
  <section class="section-padded bg-warm">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header-block">
        <div class="badge badge-primary">Generative AI Prompts</div>
        <h2 class="section-heading">Master AI Prompts for Enterprise Digital Infrastructure</h2>
        <p class="section-subtext">Copy-paste ready prompt templates for CTA optimization, content generation, quality audits, and design ideation.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prompts-list">
        <!-- Prompt 1: CTA Generation -->
        <div class="prompt-box">
          <div class="prompt-header">
            <h4>1. CTA &amp; High-Conversion Button Prompt</h4>
            <button class="btn-copy-prompt" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(document.getElementById('prompt_cta').innerText); alert('Copied CTA Prompt!');">📋 Copy</button>
          </div>
          <pre id="prompt_cta"><code>Act as a Senior Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO) and B2B Real Estate Copywriter.
Generate 10 high-impact, institutional Call-to-Action (CTA) variations for GreenNext Technologies targeting Global Cloud Hyperscalers, Private Equity Funds, and Fortune 500 tech occupiers in South India (Hosur, Tirunelveli, Trichy, Coimbatore, Madurai, Pondicherry).

Requirements:
- Target Asset Classes: 100+ MW Hyperscale Data Centers, Grade-A IT Parks, Convention Centers, EV/Robotics Precision Plants.
- Tone: Institutional, confident, high-ticket B2B, urgent yet dignified (resembling Brookfield and Embassy REIT).
- Include both primary action buttons (e.g., "Submit Institutional RFP", "Schedule Campus Delegation Visit") and secondary micro-copy (e.g., "Protected under mutual institutional NDA").</code></pre>
        </div>

        <!-- Prompt 2: Content Generation -->
        <div class="prompt-box">
          <div class="prompt-header">
            <h4>2. Technical Content &amp; Campus Dossier Generation Prompt</h4>
            <button class="btn-copy-prompt" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(document.getElementById('prompt_content').innerText); alert('Copied Content Prompt!');">📋 Copy</button>
          </div>
          <pre id="prompt_content"><code>Act as an Enterprise Digital Infrastructure and Commercial Real Estate Analyst.
Write a comprehensive 1,500-word Institutional Technical Dossier for a 100+ MW Hyperscale AI Data Center Campus in Gangaikondan / Tirunelveli, Tamil Nadu.

Structure:
1. Executive Summary &amp; Statutory Approvals (SIPCOT / Guidance TN single-window clearances)
2. Electrical Power Architecture (400kV / 230kV GIS substation, N+N redundancy, PUE 1.25, 100% green renewable power access)
3. Direct-to-Chip Liquid Cooling and Chilled Water Hydronic Loop Specifications
4. Subsea Cable Landing Connectivity &amp; Carrier-Neutral Diverse Meet-Me-Rooms
5. Commercial Terms (Powered Shell vs Turnkey Build-to-Suit vs 25-year Institutional Leaseback)</code></pre>
        </div>

        <!-- Prompt 3: Quality Audit Analysis -->
        <div class="prompt-box">
          <div class="prompt-header">
            <h4>3. Comprehensive Quality &amp; Accessibility Audit Prompt</h4>
            <button class="btn-copy-prompt" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(document.getElementById('prompt_audit').innerText); alert('Copied Audit Prompt!');">📋 Copy</button>
          </div>
          <pre id="prompt_audit"><code>Audit the web application across the following 10 evaluation criteria without modifying existing branding or core factual text:
1. Visual hierarchy (hero KPIs, card elevations, typographic contrast)
2. Spacing consistency (strict 8px system: 8px, 16px, 24px, 32px, 48px, 64px)
3. Typography (Instrument Serif, Plus Jakarta Sans, JetBrains Mono)
4. CTA visibility (sticky widgets, 1-click sample fillers, multi-step modals)
5. Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA compliance, focus outlines, ARIA attributes)
6. Mobile responsiveness (320px to 1440px breakpoints, minimum 44px tap targets)
7. Performance (Express compression, sub-50ms static delivery, zero bloat)
8. SEO &amp; Agentic Browsing (JSON-LD Organization schema, sitemap.xml, robots.txt, llms.txt)
9. Animation &amp; Motion (200-300ms ease transitions, prefers-reduced-motion)
10. Trust signals (IGBC Platinum, Tier III/IV Uptime compliance, ISO certifications)

Provide output in structured Markdown categorized into: UI Improvements, Performance Gains, a11y Enhancements, SEO Optimization, and Animation Suggestions.</code></pre>
        </div>

        <!-- Prompt 4: Design Generation -->
        <div class="prompt-box">
          <div class="prompt-header">
            <h4>4. Enterprise UI/UX Design System Generation Prompt</h4>
            <button class="btn-copy-prompt" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(document.getElementById('prompt_design').innerText); alert('Copied Design Prompt!');">📋 Copy</button>
          </div>
          <pre id="prompt_design"><code>Act as a World-Class Enterprise UI/UX Designer specializing in institutional platforms (like Brookfield, Vercel, Linear, and Stripe).
Generate a complete Design System token schema and component library for a mission-critical digital infrastructure platform.

Deliverables:
- Color Tokens: Deep evergreen (#123B35), dark forest (#0B2925), accent mint (#6BC7A7), warm off-white (#F7F8F5), and dark-band elevation surfaces.
- Components: Floating quick-contact widget, 1-click test fill button, mega-dropdown navigation, responsive technical matrix tables, and interactive campus site-matcher.
- CSS Architecture: Pure Vanilla CSS with CSS custom properties, zero Tailwind runtime dependencies, sub-50KB bundle.</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/floating-widget') %>
<%- include('partials/modal-rfp') %>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
